    <meta property="og:description" content="Nutrient management is central to global food security, ecosystem health and climate resilience, yet current practices are profoundly inequitable and unsustainable. This Perspective introduces the circular bionutrient economy as a justice-oriented framework for advancing ecological balance and social equity through the recycling of organic waste streams into agrifood systems."/>
